Index of Build Specifications
This is the index of the 49 build specifications. They are grouped by layer. Each entry gives the app number, the app name, and a one-line description.

Layer 1. Foundation
App 11. Effective-Null Builder. Constructs the effective null after selection and measurement.

App 12. N Calculator. Plans a simulation run. Tells you how many simulations you need.

App 13. Gap-Score Reporter. Descriptive tool for screening candidate gaps. Not calibrated.

App 17. STAG Schema Library. The schemas and rules as a versioned package.

App 18. Null-Model Protocol Library. The protocol as a versioned software library.

App 22. Numerical Verification Tool. Checks reported numbers against declared sources.

Layer 2. Annotation and statistics
App 1. STAG Annotation Editor. Builds one STAG annotation record from start to finish.

App 2. STAG Annotation Validator. Checks an annotation file against the schemas and rules.

App 3. PROV-O Exporter and Importer. Converts a STAG record to and from PROV-O.

App 4. Scale-Separation Record Calculator. Builds and checks one scale-separation record.

App 8. Pipeline Specification Wizard. Produces a machine-readable pipeline specification.

App 9. Full-Pipeline Simulator. The core engine of the Null-Model Protocol.

App 10. Scan-Family Comparator. Runs the same data under several scan families.

Layer 3. Storage, visualisation, and audit
App 5. STAG Graph Viewer. Interactive viewer for a complete STAG.

App 6. Partition Sensitivity Explorer. Re-derives labels under an alternative partition.

App 7. Revision History Viewer. Timeline view of a STAG's revision chain.

App 14. STAG plus Null-Model Combined Workbench. Uses both layers together.

App 15. Journal Submission Checker. Checks a submission against the reporting standards.

App 16. Teaching and Training Sandbox. Interactive environment with the worked examples.

App 19. Reproducibility Deposit Template. Template for a reproducible deposit.

