App 49. Autofill Library Service. Provides autofill for every app.

The order to build
If you want to build the suite incrementally, start with the foundation.

First. App 12, the N Calculator. The smallest app. No dependencies.

Second. App 4, the Scale-Separation Record Calculator.

Third. App 13, the Gap-Score Reporter.

Fourth. App 17, the STAG Schema Library.

Fifth. App 18, the Null-Model Protocol Library.

Sixth. App 49, the Autofill Library Service.

Seventh. App 24, the Master Workbench.

Eighth. App 1, the STAG Annotation Editor.

Ninth. App 9, the Full-Pipeline Simulator.

Tenth. App 23, the Physics Knowledge Library.

Everything else builds on these.
